      "message": "I think it should be possible to set them independently. In particular a few boards set `CONFIG_CHARGER_INPUT_CURRENT` to small values like 128 mA, but it seems like that was actually done in order to reduce what is now `CONFIG_CHARGER_MIN_INPUT_CURRENT_LIMIT`.",
