      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think they are redundant, and that accounts for one of the confusing aspects of the existing options: this sets the current limit enforced by the charger, and the option lets a board specify a minimum current limit. Just saying `MIN_INPUT_CURRENT` seems like it might somehow enforce that input current will never drop below the specified value (perhaps by terminating charge at low currents?) which is confusing.",
